    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22989" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνο-παιδίαι</span></b> , αἱ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>festival</i> at Sparta,
				<i>at which naked boys danced and went through gymnastic
				exercises,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.82
			</span></i>, etc.: later in sg., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.208d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν Λυκαίων γ.,</span>
			=
			<i>Lupercalia,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				44.11
			</span></i>.</div>
